calc bf: reads one line (a op b) from stdin where a and b are integers 0 to 99 and op is
plus or minus or star; prints the signed decimal result and a newline
cells are 32 bit integers (the verifier runs tritium bfi)
generated program follows; a comment may use no brainfuck character

